  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Monster-_Frigid_Dread_Mantis.png\" title=\"Frigid Dread Mantis\"><img alt=\"Frigid Dread Mantis\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"286\" src=\"/images/recovered/Monster-_Frigid_Dread_Mantis.png\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/recovered/Monster-_Frigid_Dread_Mantis.png\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Frigid Dread Mantis</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Monster-_Dread_the_Ice_Mantis.png\" title=\"Dread the Ice MantisForeleg Slash\"><img alt=\"Dread the Ice MantisForeleg Slash\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"132\" src=\"/images/recovered/Monster-_Dread_the_Ice_Mantis.png\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/recovered/Monster-_Dread_the_Ice_Mantis.png\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Dread the Ice Mantis<br/>Foreleg Slash</div></div></div>\n<p><b>Race:</b> Fade\n</p><p><b>Class:</b> Fighter\n</p><p>These fearsome creatures are like giant mechanical praying mantises.  Their forelegs have huge scythe like blades and their reach is enormous.  Although they are melee creatures, their slicing attack can reach tremendous distances, that rival some ranged opponents.  These creatures have also been known to cast a \"haste\" like spell, which allows them to run down even some of the fleetest of foot.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Basic_Types\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Basic Types</span></h2>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name\n</th><th>Element\n</th><th>Habitat\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Frigid Dread Mantis\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Balzack's_Burrow\" title=\"Balzack's Burrow\">Balzack's Burrow</a>\n</td></tr></table>\n<a name=\"Specials\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\"> Specials </span></h2>\n<ul><li><b>Dread the Ice Mantis</b>  is a larger more fearsome version of the Frigid Dread Mantis\n</li></ul>\n<a name=\"Champions\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Champions</span></h2>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Crypolyn_Kaptcher\" title=\"Crypolyn Kaptcher\">Crypolyn Kaptcher</a> appears in <a href=\"/wiki/Frump's_Misfortune\" title=\"Frump's Misfortune\">The Boardroom</a>\n</li></ul>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/wiki/GorgeNFloss\" title=\"GorgeNFloss\">GorgeNFloss</a> also appears in <a href=\"/wiki/Frump's_Misfortune\" title=\"Frump's Misfortune\">The Boardroom</a>\n</li></ul>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
}
